      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, a shot of epinephrine?? like an epi-pen? i dont have one of those here. do i really need that or is the benadryl enough? also the salt water thing sounds okay but my throat feels like it's actually closing up a little bit when i try to swallow... is that still just postnasal drip?",
